<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">We’re kicking this year off with a look back at 2022 and a look forward at what’s to come. </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">2022 saw the return of travel and in person events. It finally afforded us the cherished opportunity to visit with prospective clients and those already a part of the Flywire family. </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">Our focus continued to remain on developing the most advanced billing and payment strategies, patient engagement technologies, and client experience in the market and our content below reflects that. </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">Read on to find highlights and exciting moments. Thank you for continuing to be on this exciting journey with us.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: #0f476b;">-John Talaga, EVP &amp; GM, Healthcare, Flywire</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;categories=healthcare"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Flywire Resources | Sharing What We've Learned Along The Way</u></strong></span></a></p> </td> 
