<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">In this year’s annual report, Flywire conducted an independent survey of 200+ IT leaders to understand their evolving role in the new digital age and how that relates to the financial experience.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><a href="https://flywire.foleon.com/report/cio-hc-survey-2022/?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Read Here</u></strong></span></a></strong></span></p> </td> 
